; Story question: who was ever in Varrow at the same time as Edwin, and when?
; Derivation: Edwin is in varrow only [-300,-250) (asserted -300, retracted -250;
; his childhood stay was oakhollow). Intersect with everyone else's varrow intervals:
;   osric [-400,inf), tomas [-350,inf), v01 [-395,-95), v15 [-325,-25) -> [-300,-250)
;   hild [-270,-230)                                                    -> [-270,-250)
;   mara [-220,-190), greg [200,250), v10 [-50,inf), v24 [20,inf)       -> disjoint
; (Edwin himself is excluded.) Entity-ID order: tomas, hild, osric, v01, v15.
[:find ?c ?both
 :where (during [:edwin :located_in :varrow] ?ie)
        (during [?c :located_in :varrow] ?ic)
        [(!= ?c :edwin)]
        [(intersect ?ie ?ic) ?both]
        [(not-empty ?both)]]
